@startuml
title Figure 6 — UML Activity diagram — authenticated customer review
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}

|Customer Care Operator|
start
:Enter credentials;

|React operator UI|
:Submit login;

|Security / HTTP adapter|
if (Credentials valid?) then (no)
  :Reject protected request;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display authentication required;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Establish OperatorId context;
endif

|Customer Care Operator|
:Enter Customer ID;

|React operator UI|
:Choose page and optional\ntype/status/date filters;
:Request customer review page;

|Security / HTTP adapter|
:Authorize protected GET;

|Customer / Risk application|
:Build CustomerReviewQuery;
:Load bounded CustomerReviewPage\nthrough CustomerReviewQueryPort;

|Activity adapter|
if (R1 synthetic profile?) then (yes)
  :Apply the same bounded query\nto deterministic synthetic evidence;
else (R2+ relational profile)
  :Count matching activities and read one stable\ncreated_at / transaction_id page with LIMIT/OFFSET;
  :Load source RiskEvidence only for\ntransactions in the selected page;
endif

|Customer / Risk application|
if (Customer exists?) then (no)
  :Return not-found outcome;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display unknown customer;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Return CustomerReviewPage with\npage and total metadata;
endif

|React operator UI|
:Render the bounded CARD, PAYMENT, CRYPTO\npage and page-scoped risk evidence;
:Expose filters and explicit\nprevious/next navigation;

|Customer Care Operator|
:Review customer activity;
stop
@enduml
